er debates could clarify whether Constantino's self-funded campaign and recent controversies have narrowed the race beyond current expectations.", "confidence": "medium", "notes": ["Open seat: Elise Stefanik (R) is not on the ballot."]}, "overview": "Elise Stefanik's retirement leaves this R+10 North Country seat open, and Republican Anthony Constantino enters as the favorite despite never having held office. He has largely self-funded his campaign, putting about $9.5 million in and committing another $4 million late, while Democrat Blake Gendebien has raised a competitive $5.5 million and drawn increased national Democratic support. The available polling, much of it from Democratic sponsors, shows a single-digit race, and one forecaster recently moved the seat from solid to likely Republican. Constantino has faced a rebuke from the Saint Regis Mohawk Tribe over a deleted video, while Gendebien faces an FEC complaint over a foreign-national hire. Prediction markets price the Republican near an 80 percent chance, and the weight of expert ratings points to a Republican hold, though by a narrower margin than the district's raw lean would suggest.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.1406, "margin": -6.22}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.2036, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.1958, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.2007, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.1538, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.1549, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.2301, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.2417, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.1919, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.1959, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.1935, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.1967, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.2046, "margin": -5.8}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.1363, "margin": -6.8}]}